        "text": "Mid-market growth is structural, and pricing is the capability we lack",
        "supports": [
          "1",
          "2"
        ],
        "sub_points": [
          {
            "text": "More shippers, each shipping more value",
            "slide_id": "1"
          },
          {
            "text": "Network and service are strong; pricing is the gap",
            "slide_id": "2"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "2",
        "text": "We launch in four steps over six quarters, gated by a pilot review",
        "supports": [
          "3",
          "4"
